[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4310246695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118899#issuecomment-4310246695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118899","id":4310246695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAOklJw","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T02:38:02Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T04:20:50Z","body":"I'm really not a fan of this, it seems \"opposite\" from what's intuitively going on.\r\nThe usual pattern is that if you have multiple tabs, then the tabs above control the tabs below, while the opposite seems to be happening here.\r\nYou have main screen docks, and these docks have their own tabs, while this makes it seem like you can have open scenes, and each scene has its own main screen dock, which is not really intuitive (and doesn't make sense for any main screen dock other than the 2D and 3D editor).\r\n\r\nEdit: Thinking about this further it does make a bit more sense, since you can switch between different main screens and scenes independently.\r\nMaybe it would look better if the scene tabs were left-aligned instead of centered?\r\n\r\n(Aligned with lower tabs)\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"316\" alt=\"obraz\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/873b9153-19b1-4ad9-b9f9-d4d8e7c6b5ff\" />\r\n(Closer to the menu buttons)\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"316\" alt=\"obraz\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10c4ac7f-6d33-4504-bfe2-59d627c227c3\" />\r\n(And just to see how it would look, what if the main screens were then centered)\r\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"316\" alt=\"obraz\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bda7c49c-846e-4b8b-bc3c-ee449e1a6934\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4310246695/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4311109845","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118899#issuecomment-4311109845","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118899","id":4311109845,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAPZQ1Q","user":{"login":"derket25","id":161717952,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaOewA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161717952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25","html_url":"https://github.com/derket25","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derket25/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-24T06:19:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-24T06:19:16Z","body":"I think if only one scene was open, the centered layout would look bad. Therefore, I believe the scene tabs should be left-aligned.\r\n\r\nI also believe all docks, main screens and bottom panels should have a consistent tab design.\r\n\r\n(Old mockup from proposal [#12471](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12471#issue-3080167123))\r\n<img width=\"1440\" height=\"860\" alt=\"2-2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49a8e244-2fff-468b-8e50-5c8030bfc524\" />\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4311109845/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5400679776","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118899#issuecomment-5400679776","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118899","id":5400679776,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQefVYA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeW